# --- .NET ---
# bin/ and obj/ are deliberately absent (ruling R10): they shadowed real source
# directories in the JS and Rust trees.
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
TestResults/
*.nupkg

# --- Logs / local data ---
*.log
logs/
tmp/
*.sqlite-journal

# --- Backend bundle (WP-04a) ---
dist-bundle/

# --- Desktop shell (WP-05a) ---
# `tsc -b` type output for apps/desktop (Vite emits the real bundle into dist/).
dist-types/
# Tauri regenerates its ACL schemas from capabilities/ on every build.
**/src-tauri/gen/

# --- Monorepo tooling (WP-03b) ---
.eslintcache
*.timestamp-*.mjs

# The built gazetteer is a build output, not a source file (ruling R53): tens of
# megabytes, reproducible from `resources/gazetteer/manifest.json` with
# `pnpm gazetteer:build`. The ≤200 KB test fixture built by `--mini` IS committed.
/resources/gazetteer/gazetteer.db
**/gazetteer.db
!apps/backend/test/fixtures/gazetteer/mini.db
